<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sleep (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Necromancer (guild level 14)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sleep &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Puts a humanoid into a deep magic sleep: they lie down and sleep, and can't 
wake up on their own, they only dream of waking. Every half minute while the 
spell lasts, they fall asleep again if they got up. Someone in the middle of 
a fight can only try to sleep. The better your spell, the longer it lasts: 
from half a minute to several minutes.
</p><p>It works on humanoids only, and on no one already under it. The target 
resists with their mind; if you fail, they know you tried, and they turn on 
you. Awaken, or a strong enough dispel magic, breaks the sleep. It is also 
found on potions, wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
